### **Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)**
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Urban Tunnel Lane Change with Slow-Moving Vehicle" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1, :actor2 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Slow-moving vehicle in left lane" .

:actor2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Following vehicle (white SUV) attempting lane change" .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Slow-moving vehicle blocking lane" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition ;
    :description "Low-light urban tunnel environment" .

:risk1 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of rear-end collision due to sudden braking of lead vehicle" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of unsafe lane change into path of oncoming traffic" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .
```

